    <section class="pagehero plain"><div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p><h1>Privacy.</h1><p class="lede">What this website collects, and how we handle it.</p>
    </div></section>
    <section class="sec" id="legal"><div class="wrap legal-prose"><p><b>Effective October 25, 2026.</b> Tercet Law PLLC (&ldquo;Tercet,&rdquo; &ldquo;we&rdquo;) runs tercetlaw.com. This page says what the website collects and how we handle it. Information you share as a client is also covered by the confidentiality rules that bind lawyers.</p><h3>1. What the website collects</h3><ul><li><b>What you give us.</b> Your name, email, phone and any message when you use a form or book a call through Calendly.</li><li><b>How you use the site.</b> Pages visited, the link or ad that brought you here, device and browser type, through Google Analytics and the Google Ads tag (cookies).</li></ul><h3>2. Contacting us does not make you a client</h3><p>Sending a form, an email or booking a call does not create an attorney-client relationship. That begins only when we both sign an engagement letter. Until then, please don&rsquo;t send confidential details about your family, money or a dispute. A short note on what you need is enough for the first call.</p><h3>3. Why we use it</h3><ul><li>To reply, schedule a consultation and check for conflicts of interest before we take a matter.</li><li>To learn which pages help people find us.</li></ul><h3>4. What we don&rsquo;t do</h3><ul><li>We don&rsquo;t sell your information.</li><li>We don&rsquo;t put client files, or anything you tell us about your matter, into advertising or marketing tools.</li><li>Client matter files are kept in our practice systems, apart from this website.</li></ul><h3>5. Who helps us run the website</h3><p>HubSpot (contact forms), Google (Analytics, Ads, email), Calendly (scheduling), Cloudflare (website hosting). Each processes data under its own privacy terms.</p><h3>6. Cookies</h3><p>You can block cookies in your browser and opt out of Google ad personalization at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">adssettings.google.com</a>.</p><h3>7. Your choices</h3><p>Write to <a href="mailto:russ@tercetlaw.com">russ@tercetlaw.com</a> to see, correct or delete website contact information. We answer within 30 days. Records the lawyer conduct rules require us to keep are kept for the period those rules require.</p><h3>8. Changes</h3><p>If this policy changes, we update the date at the top.</p><h3>Contact</h3><p>Tercet Law PLLC &middot; <a href="mailto:russ@tercetlaw.com">russ@tercetlaw.com</a> &middot; <a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p></div></section>

  
